Language: en

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.920
This is the Technical Difficulties,
we're playing Citation Needed.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.960
Joining me today, he reads books y'know,
it's Chris Joel.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.600
Nepo Slian.

